  "name": "Question 5",
  "problem": "Let $Y$ be the set of all $2\\times 2$ real matrices with determinant $1.$ Which of the following statements are true?\n\nI. For any $A\\in Y,$ we have $(-1)\\cdot A=-A.$\n\nII. For any $A\\in Y$ and $\\alpha ,\\beta \\in R,$ we have $(\\alpha +\\beta )A=\\alpha A+\\beta A.$\n\nIII. For any $A\\in Y$ we have $2A\\in Y.$",
